{"case_id": "m04", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Given:** distance = 240 km, time = 3 hours\n\n**Solution:**\n\nAverage speed = distance ÷ time\n\n= 240 km ÷ 3 hours\n\n= **80 km/h**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.178, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 541, "output_tokens": 57, "reasoning_tokens": 5, "cost_usd": 0.000948, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["InferenceNet"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:36"}
{"case_id": "m01", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Prime factorisation:**\n\n84 = 2 × 2 × 3 × 7 = 2² × 3 × 7\n\n126 = 2 × 3 × 3 × 7 = 2 × 3² × 7\n\n**Common prime factors (lowest power of each):**\n\n2 × 3 × 7 = 42\n\n**HCF = 42**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.386, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 501, "output_tokens": 105, "reasoning_tokens": 12, "cost_usd": 0.001146, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Wafer"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:36"}
{"case_id": "m03", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Given:** R360 shared in the ratio 2 : 3 : 4.\n\n**Step 1: Total number of parts**\n\n$$2 + 3 + 4 = 9 \\text{ parts}$$\n\n**Step 2: Largest share = 4 parts out of 9**\n\n$$\\text{Largest share} = \\frac{4}{9} \\times R360$$\n\n$$= 4 \\times R40$$\n\n$$= R160$$\n\n**Answer: The person with the largest share gets R160.**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.51, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 566, "output_tokens": 141, "reasoning_tokens": 24, "cost_usd": 0.001958, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["InferenceNet"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:37"}
{"case_id": "m02", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**LCM of 12 and 18**\n\nPrime factorisation:\n\n- 12 = 2² × 3\n- 18 = 2 × 3²\n\nLCM = product of the highest power of every prime:\n\n- LCM = 2² × 3² = 4 × 9 = **36** ✓", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.676, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 477, "output_tokens": 89, "reasoning_tokens": 8, "cost_usd": 0.000708, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Sail Research"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:38"}
{"case_id": "m05", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "# Simple Interest Calculation\n\n**Given:**\n- P = R5 000\n- i = 8% = 0,08 (or 8/100)\n- n = 3 years\n\n**Formula:**\n\n$$SI = P \\times i \\times n$$\n\n**Substitution:**\n\n$$SI = 5000 \\times \\frac{8}{100} \\times 3$$\n\n$$SI = 400 \\times 3$$\n\n$$\\boxed{SI = R1\\,200}$$\n\nThe simple interest earned is **R1 200**.", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.089, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 517, "output_tokens": 147, "reasoning_tokens": 26, "cost_usd": 0.002005, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["InferenceNet"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:38"}
{"case_id": "m43", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**Given:** geometric sequence 2; 6; 18; …\n\n**Common ratio:**\n\n$$r = \\frac{6}{2} = \\frac{18}{6} = 3 \\checkmark$$\n\n**General term of a geometric sequence:**\n\n$$T_n = ar^{n-1}, \\quad \\text{with } a = 2,\\ r = 3$$\n\n**Substitute n = 8:**\n\n$$T_8 = 2 \\times 3^{8-1} = 2 \\times 3^7$$\n\n$$T_8 = 2 \\times 2187$$\n\n$$\\boxed{T_8 = 4374}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.594, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 550, "output_tokens": 183, "reasoning_tokens": 35, "cost_usd": 0.001899, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Wafer"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:39"}
{"case_id": "m41", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "## Solution\n\n**Given:** a = 7, d = 4, n = 25\n\n**Formula:**\n\n$$T_n = a + (n-1)d$$\n\n**Substitution:**\n\n$$T_{25} = 7 + (25 - 1)(4)$$\n$$T_{25} = 7 + (24)(4)$$\n$$T_{25} = 7 + 96$$\n\n$$\\boxed{T_{25} = 103}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 3.168, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 485, "output_tokens": 130, "reasoning_tokens": 25, "cost_usd": 0.001002, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Sail Research"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:39"}
{"case_id": "m44", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "## Solution\n\n**Identify the series type:**\n\nThe series 16 + 8 + 4 + … is a **geometric series** with:\n\n- First term: a = 16\n- Common ratio: r = 8/16 = ½\n\n**Check for convergence:**\n\nSince |r| = ½ < 1, the sum to infinity exists.\n\n**Apply the formula:**\n\n$$S_\\infty = \\frac{a}{1 - r}$$\n\n$$S_\\infty = \\frac{16}{1 - \\frac{1}{2}} = \\frac{16}{\\frac{1}{2}}$$\n\n$$\\boxed{S_\\infty = 32}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.677, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 483, "output_tokens": 184, "reasoning_tokens": 36, "cost_usd": 0.003308, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Morph"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:40"}
{"case_id": "m42", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**Given:** 3 + 7 + 11 + … — arithmetic sequence with a = 3, d = 4, n = 20\n\n**Formula:**\n$$S_n = \\frac{n}{2}\\left[2a + (n-1)d\\right]$$\n\n**Substitute:**\n$$S_{20} = \\frac{20}{2}\\left[2(3) + (20-1)(4)\\right]$$\n\n$$= 10\\left[6 + 76\\right]$$\n\n$$= 10 \\times 82$$\n\n$$\\boxed{S_{20} = 820}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 3.494, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 498, "output_tokens": 177, "reasoning_tokens": 40, "cost_usd": 0.003942, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["DeepInfra"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:41"}
{"case_id": "m45", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Patterns, sequences and series", "grade12"], "output": "**Σ(2k + 1), k = 1 to 10**\n\nTerms: T₁ = 3; T₂ = 5; … T₁₀ = 2(10) + 1 = 21\n\nArithmetic series with a = 3, d = 2, n = 10.\n\nS₁₀ = n/2 (a + Tₙ) = 10/2 (3 + 21) = 5 × 24\n\n**= 120**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.467, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 530, "output_tokens": 138, "reasoning_tokens": 26, "cost_usd": 0.002059, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Makora"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:42"}
{"case_id": "m07", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Exponents"], "output": "**2³ × 2²**\n\nUsing the law of exponents: aᵐ × aⁿ = aᵐ⁺ⁿ\n\n2³ × 2² = 2³⁺² = 2⁵ ✓\n\n= 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2\n\n= **32** ✓\n\n*Check: 2³ = 8 and 2² = 4, so 8 × 4 = 32 ✓*", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.594, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 502, "output_tokens": 138, "reasoning_tokens": 26, "cost_usd": 0.001454, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Wafer"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:37"}
{"case_id": "m11", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Common Fractions"], "output": "**3/4 + 2/3**\n\nConvert to a common denominator (12):\n\n$$\\frac{3}{4} = \\frac{9}{12} \\qquad \\frac{2}{3} = \\frac{8}{12}$$\n\nAdd the fractions:\n\n$$\\frac{9}{12} + \\frac{8}{12} = \\frac{17}{12}$$\n\nConvert the improper fraction to a mixed number:\n\n$$\\frac{17}{12} = 1\\frac{5}{12}$$\n\n**Answer: 1⁵⁄₁₂**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.934, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 561, "output_tokens": 157, "reasoning_tokens": 30, "cost_usd": 0.002146, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["InferenceNet"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:37"}
{"case_id": "m13", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Decimal Fractions"], "output": "**0,6 × 0,4**\n\n**Step 1:** Write each decimal as a common fraction.\n\n0,6 = 6/10 and 0,4 = 4/10\n\n**Step 2:** Multiply the fractions.\n\n6/10 × 4/10 = (6 × 4)/(10 × 10) = 24/100\n\n**Step 3:** Convert back to a decimal.\n\n24/100 = 0,24\n\n**Answer: 0,6 × 0,4 = 0,24** ✓\n\n*(Check: multiplying decimals — one decimal place × one decimal place gives two decimal places in the answer: 6 × 4 = 24 → 0,24.)*", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.15, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 531, "output_tokens": 209, "reasoning_tokens": 45, "cost_usd": 0.002144, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Wafer"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:37"}
{"case_id": "m16", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Geometry of Straight Lines"], "output": "**Solution**\n\nLet the other angle be *x*.\n\nx + 125° = 180°  (∠s on a straight line)\n\nx = 180° − 125°\n\n**x = 55°**", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.821, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 548, "output_tokens": 62, "reasoning_tokens": 5, "cost_usd": 0.000561, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["InferenceNet"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:38"}
{"case_id": "m52", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Functions and inverse functions", "grade12"], "output": "**Solution**\n\nLet y = f(x):\n\n$$y = 3x - 6$$\n\nInterchange x and y:\n\n$$x = 3y - 6$$\n\nMake y the subject:\n\n$$x + 6 = 3y$$\n\n$$y = \\frac{x + 6}{3}$$\n\n$$\\boxed{f^{-1}(x) = \\dfrac{x + 6}{3} = \\dfrac{1}{3}x + 2}$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 1.556, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 494, "output_tokens": 166, "reasoning_tokens": 62, "cost_usd": 0.001721, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Wafer"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:39"}
{"case_id": "m46", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Finance, growth and decay", "grade12"], "output": "**Given:** P = R20 000; annual rate 9% compounded monthly; n = 5 years\n\n**Adjust for monthly compounding:**\n\ni = 0,09/12 = 0,0075 ✓\n\nn = 5 × 12 = 60 ✓\n\n**Apply compound growth formula:**\n\nA = P(1 + i)ⁿ\nA = 20 000(1 + 0,0075)⁶⁰ ✓ substitution\nA = 20 000(1,56568...)\n\n**A = R31 313,62** ✓", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.277, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 500, "output_tokens": 268, "reasoning_tokens": 132, "cost_usd": 0.002701, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Wafer"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:39"}
{"case_id": "m50", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Exponential and logarithmic functions", "grade12"], "output": "**Solve for x: log₂ x = 5**\n\nBy the definition of a logarithm: log_b x = y ⇔ b^y = x\n\nlog₂ x = 5\n\n∴ x = 2⁵ ✓ (definition of log)\n\n∴ **x = 32** ✓", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 3.51, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 538, "output_tokens": 88, "reasoning_tokens": 13, "cost_usd": 0.00074, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["InferenceNet"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:41"}
{"case_id": "m54", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "moonshotai__kimi-k3@low", "model": "moonshotai/kimi-k3", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 12, "tags": ["Differential calculus", "grade12"], "output": "**Given:** f(x) = 3x⁴ − 2x² + 5x\n\nApply the power rule term by term: if f(x) = axⁿ, then f′(x) = naxⁿ⁻¹\n\n- d/dx [3x⁴] = 4(3)x³ = 12x³\n- d/dx [−2x²] = 2(−2)x = −4x\n- d/dx [5x] = 1(5)x⁰ = 5\n\n**Answer:**\n\n$$f'(x) = 12x^3 - 4x + 5$$", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 3.542, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 505, "output_tokens": 179, "reasoning_tokens": 30, "cost_usd": 0.003263, "served_models": ["moonshotai/kimi-k3"], "hosts": ["Morph"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T18:05:42"}
